Factoid 8.1. The tree information system on tree tokens, solving T congruent to A plus (T times T) by construction, has the tree bottom as its bottom token, tree consistency as its consistency predicate, and tree entailment as its entailment. Subsets of consistent sets are consistent, singletons are consistent, inserting an entailed token preserves consistency, bottom is entailed, every member is entailed, and entailment is transitive, each by the corresponding tree lemma.
